# SHELVED 2026-08-31: a design sketch for a CoreMotion surface. It takes an untyped `motion` record with a
# `native` field, but no public wave/motion module or `motion` form exists anywhere in the tree, so the
# member path has nothing to type against on any backend. Nothing loads this module. Un-shelve by declaring
# the motion form (or a `dock type` CMMotionManager handle) alongside the public API it forwards.
note draft

task is-motion-available
  # A Boolean value that indicates whether the device-motion service is available on the device.
  take motion
  call motion/native/is-device-motion-available

task is-gyroscope-available
  # A Boolean value that indicates whether a gyroscope is available on the device.
  take motion
  call motion/native/is-gyro-available

task is-magnetometer-available
  # A Boolean value that indicates whether a magnetometer is available on the device.
  take motion
  call motion/native/is-magnetometer-available

task is-accelerometer-available
  # A Boolean value that indicates whether an accelerometer is available on the device.
  take motion
  call motion/native/is-accelerometer-available
